    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 72 The Fairways is a beautifully presented two-bedroom first-floor apartment ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Seabrook Manor development directly opposite Portmarnock DART Station.\r\n\r\nThe bright and well-proportioned accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall featuring a generous hot press offering excellent storage, spacious family bathroom, open-plan kitchen, dining and living area designed for modern living. There are two generously sized double bedrooms, both benefiting from extensive fitted wardrobes. The primary bedroom is further enhanced by an en-suite bathroom.\r\n\r\nSeabrook Manor is an exclusive, secure gated community set within beautifully maintained landscaped grounds. Designed with both comfort and convenience in mind, it features underground parking and a warm family-friendly atmosphere. Residents enjoy the added benefit of an on-site crèche while the nearby DART station offers seamless access to Malahide Village and Dublin City Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t4.59 x 2.30\tDecorative timber floor, large storage press, light fittings, coving \r\n\r\nOpen-Plan Kitchen/Dining Area/Lounge\t6.21 x 3.89\tFully fitted kitchen with fitted units, fridge freezer, oven, gas hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, storage press, washer/dryer, coving, part tiled, part timber floor\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom \t4.22 x 3.68\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe, light fitting, door to balcony\r\n\r\nEn-suite\t2.72 x 1.01\tTiled floor & partially tiled walls, wc, whb, standalone shower, mirror\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2  4.6 x 3.76\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobes, light fitting\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom\t2.66 x 1.2\tTiled floor & walls, w.c., w.h.b, bath suite, shower screen, triton electric shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "2 spacious double bedrooms, master bedroom en suite \r\nGas-fired central heating \r\nSecure gated development with ample car parking spaces\r\nCommunal Rooftop Garden"
